00:27:54,048 --> 00:27:57,748
Again, this is the point of controls all sort of lined up here.

527
00:27:59,048 --> 00:28:01,948
And you got the two right off the bat, side by side.

528
00:28:03,148 --> 00:28:07,248
And then you get this third one here, just one bar removed.

529
00:28:07,348 --> 00:28:13,248
But what's important is the market tried to rally back up above this point of control.

530
00:28:14,348 --> 00:28:18,048
Where the two bars are, but we couldn't get up to the high, and then we continue lower.

531
00:28:18,048 --> 00:28:23,948
So, I mean, it's telling you that this area in here is going to be your resistance.

532
00:28:24,048 --> 00:28:29,348
As long as you can stay below it, then, you know, look for that sell-off in the short term.

533
00:28:34,608 --> 00:28:40,208
Again, in sort of the opposite direction, you've got, first you're seeing these two pointed controls here.

534
00:28:41,708 --> 00:28:42,908
Mark is working his way up,

535
00:28:42,908 --> 00:28:44,508
then you get a red, followed by a

536
00:28:44,508 --> 00:28:45,708
green, followed by another green, but

537
00:28:45,708 --> 00:28:48,108
still sort of in that area, then a red and a green.

538
00:28:48,508 --> 00:28:54,208
But what's important is you're seeing, well initially you're seeing these two pointed controls at the same level.

539
00:28:54,508 --> 00:28:57,508
You do have two here, roughly the same level.

540
00:28:58,008 --> 00:28:59,726
But then when you form this other bar

541
00:28:59,726 --> 00:29:03,806
here where you've got three in a row, then four in a row, then what you have here is...

542
00:29:05,908 --> 00:29:10,008
A ratio, a small print ratio, is telling you prices below are being rejected.

543
00:29:10,308 --> 00:29:16,708
At first you may think, well, I'm inclined to think it's going to be support because the market is rallying.

544
00:29:17,208 --> 00:29:21,908
But honestly, when you're going sideways, you don't know for sure if it's going to be support or resistance.

545
00:29:22,608 --> 00:29:24,508
The market worked its way up.

546
00:29:24,608 --> 00:29:28,708
You like to think it's going to be pausing and then be a support level, but you don't know.

547
00:29:29,008 --> 00:29:32,808
It could very well turn into a resistance level if the market starts to sell off.

548
00:29:32,908 --> 00:29:34,708
I mean, you do have a couple of red bars here.

549
00:29:35,808 --> 00:29:36,608
You know, honestly.

550
00:29:37,508 --> 00:29:43,408
Looking from this bar at 846 to the left, it's hard to tell if it's going to be support or resistance.

