556
00:29:53,174 --> 00:29:57,174
down here are being rejected and the market starts to move up.

557
00:30:00,008 --> 00:30:02,243
So even if you're not looking to get

558
00:30:02,243 --> 00:30:04,198
long in this bar, when you have

559
00:30:04,198 --> 00:30:05,595
this bar, the next bar

