00:31:20,871 --> 00:31:22,517
come off, you know, and you're

584
00:31:22,517 --> 00:31:23,340
talking, you know, 1893

585
00:31:23,340 --> 00:31:26,083
to, you know, 1888, you know, that's a five point move.

