00:31:27,308 --> 00:31:28,108
That's giving you

587
00:31:29,408 --> 00:31:29,608
some

588
00:31:30,208 --> 00:31:32,908
solid trading opportunities there.

589
00:31:33,508 --> 00:31:41,308
Now, what happens over the next 45 minutes, you get basically three point of controls around the same levels.

590
00:31:41,308 --> 00:31:43,608
I mean, they're different by a tick at each level.

